ecomment-1996597424). Hence I'm leaving my review here.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98122#pullrequestreview-3487847449","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98122","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-11-20T13:30:05Z"},{"id":3501370470,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7Qsqxm","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40275683?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/cadence-s","id":40275683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMjc1Njgz","login":"cadence-s","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/cadence-s"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98122#pullrequestreview-3501370470","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98122","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-11-24T16:54:01Z"},{"id":3501552314,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7QtXK6","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?u=a04daf8c4d579b733ac46d2e4d17324cca7870c0&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","login":"kleonc","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98122#pullrequestreview-3501552314","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98122","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-11-24T17:45:47Z"},{"id":3502087281,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7QvZxx","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40275683?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/cadence-s","id":40275683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMjc1Njgz","login":"cadence-s","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/cadence-s"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98122#pullrequestreview-3502087281","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98122","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-11-24T20:14:00Z"},{"id":3507584385,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7REX2B","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"fc9ea462cad98308baac555caa23ca5057821e39","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?u=a04daf8c4d579b733ac46d2e4d17324cca7870c0&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","login":"kleonc","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc"},"body":"LGTM, fixes the issue.\r\n\r\n[As the rendering team wanted](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/82193#issuecomment-1996597424) the repeat flag is being enabled/disabled automatically. However, according to my suggestion, it's done in a slightly different manner than originally suggested, as it's based on the final UV region used instead of solely based on the `Sprite3D.region` (this makes it work e.g. for AtlasTextures). Nevertheless, this should get an approval from the rendering team before merging.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98122#pullrequestreview-3507584385","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98122","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-11-26T00:31:56Z"},{"id":3528334424,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7SThxY","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"fc9ea462cad98308baac555caa23ca5057821e39","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?u=e44a465cbebabb9ea2be80b59e6dc07966bef5b7&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","login":"clayjohn","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98122#pullrequestreview-3528334424","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98122","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-12-02T06:20:29Z"}]